	"data": "Reference: Lessons Learned\n\nExtracted rules from real sessions. Promoted from .learnings/. See also lessons.md.\n\nInfrastructure / Networking\nOllama on star: OLLAMA_HOST=0.0.0.0:11434 needs systemctl edit ollama to persist across reboots — assume it needs re-enabling after reboots until fixed\nGateway bind: Keep gateway.bind=loopback with gateway.tailscale.mode=serve — changing to network breaks Tailscale Serve proxy\nDocker builds on ARM: Never run heavy builds (Node/Vite) on pi5/ARM. OOM risk.…",
